      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 896,
        "height": 752,
        "content": "# Contract Compliance Violation Detection\n\nThis workflow acts as an automated **Compliance Engine** for the procurement process. It continuously monitors daily purchasing transactions from Google Sheets, matches them against active contract terms in Notion, and calculates exact financial leakage. By leveraging AI to analyze historical vendor trends, it shifts procurement from reactive error-catching to proactive systemic contract enforcement.\n\n\n## Setup Steps\n\n* **Daily Cron Trigger** \u2014 Run the workflow automatically on a daily schedule at 6:00 AM.\n\n\n* **Fetch Active Contracts** \u2014 Retrieve currently active contract terms and pricing baselines from Notion.\n\n\n* **Fetch Recent Transactions** \u2014 Pull the latest procurement transactions and invoices from a Google Sheet.\n\n\n* **Compare Terms vs Actuals** \u2014 Execute the core logic to identify overcharges, calculate exact transaction leakage, and flag SLA or volume breaches.\n\n\n* **Violation Router** \u2014 Route the workflow into compliant and non-compliant branches based on the analysis.\n\n\n* **Log Compliant Transactions** \u2014 Archive clean transactions to a Google Sheet tab to maintain a secure audit trail.\n\n\n* **Fetch Violation History** \u2014 Query the historical Google Sheets log to identify repeat vendor infractions.\n\n\n* **Analyze Trends & Leakage** \u2014 Calculate cumulative historical leakage and format trend data for the AI engine.\n\n\n* **Batch Current Violations** \u2014 Loop over the detected violations to process them individually through the AI model.\n\n\n* **AI Analysis Chain** \u2014 Use a Groq-powered LLM with a structured output parser to evaluate the violation alongside historical trends, generating corrective actions.\n\n\n* **Slack Alert Procurement** \u2014 Send an immediate, context-rich notification to the designated Slack channel detailing the leakage and AI recommendation.\n\n\n* **Log Violation Details** \u2014 Append the specific violation metrics, trend data, and AI strategy back into the main audit sheet."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
